sequenceDiagram
    actor Browser
    participant WebBFF as Web BFF / API gateway
    participant Basket as Basket API
    participant Redis as Basket Redis
    participant Bus as Event bus (RabbitMQ; Azure Service Bus alternative)
    participant Ordering as Ordering API
    participant OrderingSQL as Ordering SQL
    participant Catalog as Catalog API
    participant CatalogSQL as Catalog SQL
    participant Payment as Payment API
    participant SignalR as Ordering SignalR Hub

    Browser->>WebBFF: Checkout over HTTP/REST
    WebBFF->>Basket: POST api/v1/Basket/checkout (x-requestid)
    Basket->>Redis: GetBasketAsync(user identity)
    Redis-->>Basket: Customer basket
    Basket->>Bus: Publish UserCheckoutAcceptedIntegrationEvent
    Basket-->>WebBFF: HTTP 202 Accepted
    WebBFF-->>Browser: HTTP 202 Accepted
    Note over Browser,Bus: Acceptance ends the HTTP request; all processing below is asynchronous

    Bus-->>Ordering: Deliver UserCheckoutAcceptedIntegrationEvent
    Ordering->>Ordering: Handle with IdentifiedCommand(CreateOrderCommand, RequestId)
    Ordering->>OrderingSQL: Begin transaction; add order and integration-event records
    Ordering->>OrderingSQL: Commit order
    Ordering->>Bus: Publish OrderStartedIntegrationEvent
    Ordering->>Bus: Publish OrderStatusChangedToSubmittedIntegrationEvent
    Bus-->>Basket: Deliver OrderStartedIntegrationEvent
    Basket->>Redis: Delete checked-out basket
    Ordering->>Bus: Publish OrderStatusChangedToAwaitingValidationIntegrationEvent
    Bus-->>Catalog: Deliver OrderStatusChangedToAwaitingValidationIntegrationEvent
    Catalog->>CatalogSQL: Validate stock and, when valid, decrement stock

    alt Stock confirmed
        Catalog->>Bus: Publish stock-confirmed result (exact contract not supplied)
        Bus-->>Ordering: Deliver stock-confirmed result
        Ordering->>OrderingSQL: Change order state; save
        Ordering->>Bus: Publish OrderStatusChangedToStockConfirmedIntegrationEvent
        Bus-->>SignalR: Deliver OrderStatusChangedToStockConfirmedIntegrationEvent
        SignalR->>SignalR: Notify connected clients
        Bus-->>Payment: Deliver OrderStatusChangedToStockConfirmedIntegrationEvent
        Payment->>Bus: Publish OrderPaymentSuccededIntegrationEvent
        Bus-->>Ordering: Deliver OrderPaymentSuccededIntegrationEvent
        Ordering->>OrderingSQL: Mark order paid; save
        Ordering->>Bus: Publish paid status (exact contract not supplied)
        Bus-->>SignalR: Deliver paid order-status event
        SignalR->>SignalR: Notify connected clients
    else Stock rejected
        Catalog->>Bus: Publish stock-rejected result (exact contract not supplied)
        Bus-->>Ordering: Deliver stock-rejected result
        Ordering->>OrderingSQL: Cancel order; save
    end

    opt Payment failure variant required by fixture
        Note over Payment,Ordering: The supplied evidence does not identify the failure contract, resulting state change, or notification
    end
